    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel's built-in function tracing infrastructure",
      "source_hash": 12187904162264635609,
      "context_hash": 14242089098763232982,
      "translation": "커널에 내장된 함수 트레이싱 인프라",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "tracing": "트레이싱"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What ftrace is",
      "source_hash": 9678471568731392166,
      "context_hash": 8260031950473839866,
      "translation": "ftrace란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ftrace": "ftrace"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ftrace is the kernel's main tracing framework, accessible via tracefs at `/sys/kernel/tracing/`.",
      "source_hash": 4312805879796110613,
      "context_hash": 11945794943898464132,
      "translation": "ftrace는 커널의 주요 트레이싱 프레임워크이며, tracefs를 통해 `/sys/kernel/tracing/`에서 접근할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ftrace": "ftrace",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "tracing": "트레이싱"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Created by Steven Rostedt and introduced in Linux 2.6.27 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/16444a8a40d4c7b4f6de34af0cae1f76a4f6c901) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/290277/), it:",
      "source_hash": 6547275640133705110,
      "context_hash": 15567123790555192093,
      "translation": "Steven Rostedt가 만들었고 Linux 2.6.27에서 도입되었으며 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/16444a8a40d4c7b4f6de34af0cae1f76a4f6c901) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/290277/), 다음과 같은 일을 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Records every kernel function call (function tracer)",
      "source_hash": 6203562979122406643,
      "context_hash": 9639833236582157917,
      "translation": "모든 커널 함수 호출 기록(function tracer)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Traces execution paths and call graphs (function_graph tracer)",
      "source_hash": 14543721707900526509,
      "context_hash": 9851839951122034562,
      "translation": "실행 경로와 호출 그래프 추적(function_graph tracer)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Provides a ring buffer for low-overhead event collection",
      "source_hash": 12637476710477236121,
      "context_hash": 10410237263610299428,
      "translation": "오버헤드가 낮은 이벤트 수집을 위한 링 버퍼 제공",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "overhead": "오버헤드",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Is the backend for BPF `fentry`/`fexit` (Linux 5.5) [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/fec56f5890d93fc2ed74166c397dc186b1c25951), kprobes, and tracepoints",
      "source_hash": 15289626386585440832,
      "context_hash": 13205993728751428768,
      "translation": "BPF `fentry`/`fexit`(Linux 5.5) [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/fec56f5890d93fc2ed74166c397dc186b1c25951), kprobe, 트레이스포인트의 백엔드 역할",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "backend": "백엔드",
        "kprobes": "kprobe",
        "tracepoints": "트레이스포인트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "tracefs interface",
      "source_hash": 8810442696901603133,
      "context_hash": 2307214990645813884,
      "translation": "tracefs 인터페이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "tracefs was introduced as a standalone filesystem in Linux 4.1 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/4282d60689d4f21b40692029080440cc58e8a17d).",
      "source_hash": 106661610752013389,
      "context_hash": 2320567460181464924,
      "translation": "tracefs는 Linux 4.1에서 독립된 파일시스템으로 도입되었습니다 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/4282d60689d4f21b40692029080440cc58e8a17d).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Function tracer",
      "source_hash": 12684564047725461400,
      "context_hash": 10367161363524504429,
      "translation": "Function tracer",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Function graph tracer",
      "source_hash": 10737061281011383955,
      "context_hash": 6872528431527435873,
      "translation": "Function graph tracer",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Shows call hierarchy and execution time.",
      "source_hash": 17989439087158941664,
      "context_hash": 4607298253404257972,
      "translation": "호출 계층 구조와 실행 시간을 보여 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Added by Frédéric Weisbecker in Linux 2.6.29 [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/15e6cb3673ea6277999642802406a764b49391b0).",
      "source_hash": 14419983658678121607,
      "context_hash": 17470539675607758063,
      "translation": "Frédéric Weisbecker가 Linux 2.6.29에서 추가했습니다 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/15e6cb3673ea6277999642802406a764b49391b0).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How ftrace instruments functions",
      "source_hash": 8118773685800320915,
      "context_hash": 16255920893509274052,
      "translation": "ftrace가 함수를 계측하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ftrace": "ftrace",
        "functions": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When `CONFIG_DYNAMIC_FTRACE=y` and `CONFIG_HAVE_FENTRY=y`, the compiler inserts a call to `__fentry__` (or `mcount`) at the start of every traceable function:",
      "source_hash": 2638250538778506652,
      "context_hash": 13689186134679922751,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_DYNAMIC_FTRACE=y`이고 `CONFIG_HAVE_FENTRY=y`이면, 컴파일러는 트레이스 가능한 모든 함수의 시작 부분에 `__fentry__`(또는 `mcount`) 호출을 삽입합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When tracing is disabled, these calls are patched to `nop` instructions at boot time — **zero overhead when not tracing**.",
      "source_hash": 2969997113734933457,
      "context_hash": 12578594221916333008,
      "translation": "트레이싱이 비활성화되어 있으면 이 호출들은 부팅 시점에 `nop` 명령어로 패치되므로, **트레이싱하지 않을 때는 오버헤드가 전혀 없습니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "overhead": "오버헤드",
        "tracing": "트레이싱"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "When enabled:",
      "source_hash": 4193027522419308756,
      "context_hash": 14998334550129536998,
      "translation": "활성화된 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`ftrace_caller` looks up which tracers are registered for this function and calls them.",
      "source_hash": 12125823169769617171,
      "context_hash": 9503977292533436150,
      "translation": "`ftrace_caller`는 이 함수에 어떤 트레이서가 등록되어 있는지 조회한 뒤 그 트레이서들을 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "The patching is done with `text_poke_bp()` — a breakpoint-based patching technique that avoids stopping all CPUs.",
      "source_hash": 14637894918513319570,
      "context_hash": 4643848280352661167,
      "translation": "패치는 `text_poke_bp()`로 수행합니다. 이는 모든 CPU를 멈추지 않아도 되는, 브레이크포인트 기반의 패치 기법입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Since Linux 5.x with `CONFIG_HAVE_FENTRY`, the compiler uses `__fentry__` (called before the function prologue saves registers) rather than `mcount`, which makes the hook faster and allows reliable stack unwinding.",
      "source_hash": 15276390783120962809,
      "context_hash": 9665263546513514716,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_HAVE_FENTRY`가 설정된 Linux 5.x부터 컴파일러는 `mcount` 대신 `__fentry__`(함수 프롤로그가 레지스터를 저장하기 전에 호출됨)를 사용하며, 이로써 훅이 더 빨라지고 신뢰할 수 있는 스택 언와인딩이 가능해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "function": "함수",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Ring buffer",
      "source_hash": 11763189425168488491,
      "context_hash": 18368350188882172855,
      "translation": "링 버퍼",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ftrace uses a lockless per-CPU ring buffer (`kernel/trace/ring_buffer.c`):",
      "source_hash": 6089426385678966257,
      "context_hash": 16163999944745432101,
      "translation": "ftrace는 락 없는(lockless) per-CPU 링 버퍼(`kernel/trace/ring_buffer.c`)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "ftrace": "ftrace",
        "ring buffer": "링 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Each CPU writes to its own buffer (no lock contention)",
      "source_hash": 15878697388033687688,
      "context_hash": 12260250459580047334,
      "translation": "각 CPU가 자신의 버퍼에 기록(락 경합 없음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "lock contention": "락 경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Ring behavior: old events are overwritten when full (unless `trace_options` has `overwrite` disabled)",
      "source_hash": 12645799174291806549,
      "context_hash": 8503658144376608492,
      "translation": "링 동작: 버퍼가 가득 차면 오래된 이벤트를 덮어씀(`trace_options`에서 `overwrite`가 비활성화된 경우 제외)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Events are timestamped with per-CPU clock",
      "source_hash": 1626326691783530505,
      "context_hash": 3205868766974418555,
      "translation": "이벤트에 per-CPU 클록으로 타임스탬프 기록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:26:29.306728Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Dynamic events: kprobe_events and uprobe_events",
      "source_hash": 15330304548576925834,
      "context_hash": 1173690689724578337,
